# Reviewed SHA-256 pins for every archive Dockerfile.tools installs by hand.
# Sources: Kubernetes release checksums, AWS CLI versioned archives,
# microsoft/go-sqlcmd GitHub Release assets, the AWS Session Manager plugin,
# MongoDB's published archive digests, and Oracle Instant Client. A version
# bump must update both architectures here before either agent-tools train can
# build or publish.
#
# Anything fetched with curl/wget and then installed or executed belongs here:
# apt has its own signature chain, but these downloads have none, and several
# run code at build time (dpkg maintainer scripts, sqlplus -V).
